{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1517240-vampires-must-love-how-humans-are-enamored-by-the-concept-of-democracy","id":1517240,"title":"Vampires must love how humans are enamored by the concept of democracy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-05T20:13:01-07:00","id":1517240,"title":"Vampires must love how humans are enamored by the concept of democracy","content":"In an ideal world, people would vote for candidates not because of similar ideology or party, but because they are actually what a city/state/country needs. The issue here is that we don't live in an ideal world. People who know little to nothing about politics have the same vote as the guy who has a greater understanding of geopolitics, law, and economics. This in the sense turns elections into a popularity contest, where candidates who are somewhat charismatic are voted in by people who don't really understand the consequences of their actions.<br /> <br /> For that reason alone, vampires, creatures that thrive on deception and misinformation, must love the concept of democracy. The most common in clan disciplines are perfect for participating in politics, and unlike vampire society where it's a given by all vampires that they are a pawn in another's game, mortals on the other hand have no clue, and at times seem incapable of understanding how those within the government have their own plots and plans that the public is not privy to. In fact voters are so easy to manipulate to the point that it is wholly unnecessary to use supernatural powers.<br /> <br /> For example, voters have been shown over and over again to be easily manipulated whenever politicians demonize another group. Voters will eat up lies from their politicians and other obviously biased individuals regarding these groups, all while having little to no knowledge about the group in question. What I am trying to get at, is that if normal humans can do this, it should be a walk in the park for vampires.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-05T21:07:07-07:00","id":1517245,"title":"","content":"To be fair, all of your points works for every conceivable political system.<br /> Monarchy? Blood bond the monarch.<br /> Military dictature? Use mental disciplines to control the military leadership.<br /> Democratic regime? &quot;Meet&quot; the candidates of election with a welcome gift of red drink.<br /> <br /> <br /> For vampires, the type of regime of the mortals is fluff. They can always control it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T00:39:24-07:00","id":1517250,"title":"","content":"In fact, you could make an argument that with vampires overseeing a given government that between dominate, blood bonds, presence, and absurd amounts of wealth on tap, that the politicians will be following orders rather than their own self interests. Imagine a leadership with centuries of experience rather than merely years or decades of experience.<br /> <br /> Also on a minor note, I believe Vampires love Republics, rather than Democracies. It is far easier to influence the elected representatives or back them initially, rather than trying to mass influence the entire population into voting one way or another. With social media this is less of a problem, but the whole social media and internet thing is really only around 30 years old at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T02:25:21-07:00","id":1517257,"title":"","content":"If anything they probably dislike the concept of democracy as the turnover in leadership makes pawn maintenence difficult. Plus the big players such as heads of state and cabinet members have the issue that other vampires and supernaturals are going to covet your assets.<br /> <br /> Its also probably worth noting vampiric interests dont match up with human politics very well. For example lax gun laws and well funded police are actually disadvantagous to them but political disenfranchisement of people due to crime is highly beneficial.<br /> <br /> personally I think mostly they look for is high corruption levels and reduced accountability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T03:40:12-07:00","id":1517260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1517240-vampires-must-love-how-humans-are-enamored-by-the-concept-of-democracy?p=1517257#post1517257\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anything they probably dislike the concept of democracy as the turnover in leadership makes pawn maintenence difficult. Plus the big players such as heads of state and cabinet members have the issue that other vampires and supernaturals are going to covet your assets.<br /> <br /> Its also probably worth noting vampiric interests dont match up with human politics very well. For example lax gun laws and well funded police are actually disadvantagous to them but political disenfranchisement of people due to crime is highly beneficial.<br /> <br /> personally I think mostly they look for is high corruption levels and reduced accountability.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it really depends on the aspect you value more.<br /> <br /> Strict gun laws, under funded police, and alternative lifestyle tolerance means that Vampires love the liberals. It makes hunting easy, it makes it harder for hunters to be sufficiently armed, and your Herd/ghouls can just take the title of a polycule. No one will look twice at your weird fashion ideas, and even the body mod enthusiasts provide cover for flesh crafters to run around publicly.<br /> <br /> On the flip side if vampires have a conservative leadership in place, then generational wealth is protected (makes maintaining fortunes easier), businesses are left to do what ever they want, the fewer permits you have to get makes being a vampire so much easier, lax weapons laws mean you can roll with a much more heavily armed coterie or bodyguards, etc. <br /> <br /> Vampires in control of government is like the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PvFYBkesqGU\" target=\"_blank\">Farengi Rules of Acquisition</a>. It doesn't matter who is in charge, what they represent, or even what they hope to achieve. You just use whomever and whatever is available to advance your plans. Hence the 34th and 35th rules being contradictory and true at the same time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T04:37:25-07:00","id":1517264,"title":"","content":"Yeah thats sort of my point. Vampires don't really integrate well into human ideologies since thei interests are to broad and alien to fit into one group (ultimatly be because theyre our enemy and oppressor). the example always remember is the Sabbat benifitting from lax border control since it made it easy to bring groups they're associated inbut also benifit from institutional racism because it cultivates an environment were sabbat prosper with edemic violence and poverty.The ferengi are probably the closest to their ideal since corruption is not only the norm but explicitly encouraged","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 07-06-2023, 09:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T06:12:44-07:00","id":1517270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1517240-vampires-must-love-how-humans-are-enamored-by-the-concept-of-democracy?p=1517245#post1517245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be fair, all of your points works for every conceivable political system.<br /> Monarchy? Blood bond the monarch.<br /> Military dictature? Use mental disciplines to control the military leadership.<br /> Democratic regime? &quot;Meet&quot; the candidates of election with a welcome gift of red drink.<br /> <br /> <br /> For vampires, the type of regime of the mortals is fluff. They can always control it.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but I feel those types of governments tend to have less pawns and more competition to gain power over said pawns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T08:34:07-07:00","id":1517281,"title":"","content":"Or I would focus on the support staff that will most likely will be still there despite changes in the leadership as Mayors, Premiers, and Prime Ministers come and go like clock work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T10:21:47-07:00","id":1517289,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1517240-vampires-must-love-how-humans-are-enamored-by-the-concept-of-democracy?p=1517281#post1517281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or I would focus on the support staff that will most likely will be still there despite changes in the leadership as Mayors, Premiers, and Prime Ministers come and go like clock work.</div> </div> </div> </div>They genrally target administrators and bureaucrats from I recall. Ghouling the president is a recipe for disaster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T16:00:29-07:00","id":1517314,"title":"","content":"I think that democracy in the modern nights within the WOD is an illusion and that the political party feud is just a convenient show to divert the alienated public's attention to the truth that all competitors are in some way affiliated with the area's dominant sect , and that regardless of the result, if the result is not already in place, it is irrelevant, since who is in charge are the kindred, now and ever, and as a bonus, political positions are conceived by the preference of the kindred in question, such as the particular tastes of the Ventrue for example. Any resemblance to the real world is purely coincidental.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T22:41:27-07:00","id":1517330,"title":"","content":"I imagine that vampires now as in the past, let humans rise to leadership positions and then assert control over those leaders, only taking overt action for particular beneficial or troublesome leaders.<br /> <br /> In modern democracies, corporations and the rich elites already largely control politicians. It\u2019s probably better to establish control on that end, the people and institutions already giving the politicians orders who don\u2019t get replaced ever 4 years.<br /> <br /> They are neither right nor left, but keep all parties in the box of acceptable policies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1129,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","user":"Sergeant Brother","date":". 07-07-2023, 01:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-06T23:01:45-07:00","id":1517331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1517240-vampires-must-love-how-humans-are-enamored-by-the-concept-of-democracy?p=1517245#post1517245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Democratic regime? &quot;Meet&quot; the candidates of election with a welcome gift of red drink.</div> </div> </div> </div>The WoD version of the Grimace shake gives you Potence.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">red drank</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-07T08:25:35-07:00","id":1517357,"title":"","content":"I think it would be more accurate to say that vampires love the Iron Law of Oligarchy, and how it tends to turn every system into feudalism no matter what it starts as.<br /> <br /> Humans are tribalistic creatures who care for themselves, their family, and their friends much more than humanity at large.<br /> <br /> The functioning of society requires specialization and division of labor. Which means that some small group, even in a democracy, must perform leadership functions and most people will be too busy performing their own specialization to monitor that group closely.<br /> <br /> This means that there will always be a small group of people with leadership power who care more about themselves, their families, and their golfing buddies than about society as a whole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}